  "annotations": [
    {
      "id": "note-a",
      "x": 0,
      "y": -150,
      "w": 900,
      "text": "Chosen: A \u00b7 Quote Desk. Photos sit on the quote line they belong to. Spencers rows are violet-tagged, Downer rows orange-tagged, with KO reference and SLA clock. Sidebar shows the Quoting view.",
      "page": "page-1"
    },
    {
      "id": "note-mode",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 910,
      "w": 900,
      "text": "Josh's default is the Quoting view: two tabs (Quotes, Quote runs) and one Full app button. The full app adds Schedule (trucks), Clients, Reports and the rest. Same account, same data; only the navigation changes, and the choice is remembered per device.",
      "page": "page-1"
    },
    {
      "id": "note-records",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 1970,
      "w": 900,
      "text": "Two job records, same layout: a private job (Margaret) and a Spencers job (violet band, KO reference, SOR-coded lines, quotable pre-approval line highlighted, portal actions in the \u2026 menu, portal notes in the feed).",
      "page": "page-1"
    },
    {
      "id": "note-shared",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 3010,
      "w": 900,
      "text": "Scheduler: trucks as rows, people as chips, leave greyed out, tray only holds Accepted work. Spencers and Downer blocks keep their violet / orange colours on the grid.",
      "page": "page-1"
    },
    {
      "id": "note-other",
      "x": 0,
      "y": -150,
      "w": 900,
      "text": "Kept for reference only. B (Flow Board) could return later as an optional board view on the Quotes tab; C (Today) ideas fold into the 'Needs me' grouping at the top of the A list.",
      "page": "page-2"
    }
  ],
